        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Modern Drummer, Bookmarks, Rolling Stone\n- People: Keith Moon\n- Organizations: Modern Drummer Hall of Fame\n- Topics: Drumming, percussion, literary magazines\n\nFacts:\n- Modern Drummer is a monthly publication targeting the interests of drummers and percussionists.\n- Bookmarks is a bimonthly American literary magazine dedicated to general readers, book groups, and librarians.\n- In 1982, Keith Moon was posthumously inducted into the Modern Drummer Hall of Fame and became only the second rock drummer chosen.\n- In 2011, Keith Moon was voted the second-greatest drummer in history in a Rolling Stone readers' poll.",
